  "title": "First Chechen War",
  "summary": "War between Russia and the breakaway Chechen Republic of Ichkeria. Yeltsin ordered the army to restore constitutional order on 1 December 1994, and a heavy assault on Grozny followed. It ended with the Khasavyurt Accords of August 1996 after a Chechen counterattack retook Grozny. Estimates of civilian deaths range from 20,000 to 100,000.",
